# The compiler's line starts with the header's path on the machine, so the
# message is a contains: line. Natively and on WASI the same text is
# test/messages/async_argon2id_without_threads, a compile-diagnostic: Emscripten
# without -pthread has no threads, as wasip2 and wasip3 have none.
[all]
targets: emscripten
build: fails
contains: webcpp::hash: async_argon2id runs on another thread and needs a build with threads (natively, remove WEBCPP_HASH_NO_THREADS; on Emscripten, link with -pthread). Without threads, call argon2id.
